# CFD Geometry Exports

This folder contains exported geometries dedicated to CFD analysis for ATA 53-00-04 (Design).

## Naming convention

Files MUST follow:

`53-00-04-ANLS-CFD-xxx_RevX_*`

- `53-00-04` – ATA / design section identifier.
- `ANLS` – Analysis artifact.
- `CFD` – Analysis type: CFD.
- `xxx` – Component or geometry code (e.g. `FWDSECT`, `WNG`, `DOOR01`).
- `RevX` – Geometry revision (e.g. `RevA`, `RevB`, `Rev01`).
- `*` – Optional suffix for format and run details
  (e.g. `_Geom.stp`, `_Mesh.msh`, `_Run01-Setup.json`, `_Run01-Results.h5`).

## Typical files per geometry

For each geometry `xxx`, the recommended set is:

- Geometry: `53-00-04-ANLS-CFD-xxx_RevX_Geom.stp`
- Mesh: `53-00-04-ANLS-CFD-xxx_RevX_Mesh.msh`
- Run setup (optional): `53-00-04-ANLS-CFD-xxx_RevX_RunNN-Setup.*`
- Run results (optional): `53-00-04-ANLS-CFD-xxx_RevX_RunNN-Results.*`

CFD is **optional**; this folder may be empty apart from `.gitkeep` in programs where no CFD analysis is required.
